* * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *
15 Aug 86   Nickell.pasa     Re: Overloading Buttons, again (finally?)
Date: Fri, 15 Aug 86 13:45:10 PDT
From: Nickell.pasa
Subject: Re: Overloading Buttons, again (finally?)
